simd_operator_undefined.nra:12:25: & is not defined on F32x4, whose lanes are floats; it takes integer vectors
simd_operator_undefined.nra:13:19: ~ is not defined on F32x4, whose lanes are floats; it takes integer vectors
simd_operator_undefined.nra:15:3: / is not defined on I32x4: no SIMD instruction divides integer lanes; read the lanes with v[i] and divide them one at a time
